/E (Pixartek was created in response to the difficulties many students face when learning to paint due to traditional teaching methods, the lack of personalized guidance, and the perception that art is difficult to master. We chose this problem after observing in our school environment how these barriers can limit students' interest, confidence, and artistic skill development.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0]
