/E (Pixartek is an intelligent robotic assistant designed to teach painting in an interactive, practical, and personalized way. It uses artificial intelligence-powered cameras to observe the painter's movements and analyze brushstrokes, direction, speed, contour tracking, and color use in real time, providing instructions to correct and improve their technique. It also features an automatic paint dispensing system that prepares and provides the exact colors in the quantities needed for each stage of the artwork.)
