/E (The computer vision system was developed using a Mac mini M4 connected to a camera via USB, which captures images quickly. The camera is placed on an adjustable mount to adapt to the size and angle of the canvas. An infrared camera was also installed to track the paintbrush and detect the direction and speed of its movements. The entire system is powered by a stable power supply, allowing it to monitor the user's progress in real time and generate recommendations throughout the artistic process.)
