/T (To improve analysis accuracy, the robot features paintbrushes that use positioning technology and infrared sensors to determine the direction, speed, and alignment of each brushstroke.To build each electronic paintbrush, we took a flashlight and replaced its light with an infrared LED. Then we 3D-printed an adapter that holds a regular brush head on one side and the flashlight on the other. The result is a brush that looks normal but gives off a light that only the infrared camera can see.)
/E (To improve analysis accuracy, the robot features paintbrushes that use positioning technology and infrared sensors to determine the direction, speed, and alignment of each brushstroke.To build each electronic paintbrush, we took a flashlight and replaced its light with an infrared LED. Then we 3D-printed an adapter that holds a regular brush head on one side and the flashlight on the other. The result is a brush that looks normal but gives off a light that only the infrared camera can see.)
