/E (The result is concerning: historical artistic styles, movements, and stories are no longer actively practiced or taught, increasing the risk of their disappearance over time. It is not just about losing techniques, but also ways of seeing the world, cultural identities, and forms of expressing the human experience.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
