315 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 189 0 R
/E (Pixartek will help people who face limitations in accessing structured art instruction or personalized feedback. Many learners struggle to make progress in painting due to a lack of real-time guidance. With Pixartek, users receive step-by-step assistance directly on the canvas, allowing them to learn at their own pace while improving their accuracy, technique, and confidence. Additionally, Pixartek reconnects users with the emotional and cultural value of art by integrating the stories and styles of historical artists into the learning process. This transforms painting into an immersive experience where users not only create art but also understand its origins, context, and evolution. In this way, users develop both technical skills and a deeper appreciation for artistic heritage.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
