/E (One possible negative effect is that people who learn to paint with Pixartek may later develop a dependency on the system, limiting their ability to create their own style. This potential negative effect only applies to users who are interested in learning to paint in their own way, without Pixartek. However, Pixartek will always offer options to practice painting while gradually reducing its assistance, encouraging users to progress independently and develop their own style.)
