/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 191 0 R
/E (Pixartek has multiple practical use cases in different settings, especially in education, culture, and independent learning. In schools and art academies, it allows students to learn painting techniques through guided instruction and real-time feedback, supporting the development of skills from basic to advanced levels. It can also be used in museums and cultural spaces, allowing visitors to interact with artworks, understand their creative process and historical value, and recreate them. Another use for Pixartek is as a form of entertainment for elderly people living in nursing homes, allowing them to create paintings that they can give as gifts or sell to raise funds. Additionally, it contributes to the preservation of art, history, and culture by making it possible to digitize and reproduce traditional styles. On a personal level, anyone can use Pixartek at home as an accessible tool to learn and practice painting independently, making art a more engaging, modern, and interactive experience.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [3]
>>
