/Title (PIXARTEK is more than a robot; it is a form of intelligent art preservation. It is our solution to keeping people connected to their creativity, preventing the loss of artistic skills, and protecting our cultural heritage at the same time. With this project, we demonstrate that technology can be used to solve real-world problems and make the world a more creative and accessible place.)
